content.text:
Now CSS. Add split styles including dark mode, sr-only utility, range table, picker, summary, chips, mini-button, wide modal, scrollbar.

Also mobile adjustments.

Insert near end after dark styles or before dark. Add base styles before dark so dark overrides can come after. I'll add base block before `/* Preference-aware...` and dark overrides at end. Actually the dark overrides for new elements need to be appended at the end to override base. Base can also be at end but then dark earlier would lose. Put base before the "Preference-aware" comment, then dark additions at the very end.

Design:

